Package: jatayu-pdf-studio
Version: 0.10.6-1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: JatayuOS Project
Depends: python3, python3-tk, python3-fitz, bubblewrap, libseccomp2
Recommends: kdialog, wl-clipboard, xclip
Homepage: https://jatayuos.in
Description: PDF reader and review tool for JatayuOS
 Read PDFs, highlight text, save annotated copies, and bookmark either a
 whole page or a specific reading position.
